<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: Czech cbank one-wk rev repo sells out at max 39pct.</title>
<headline>Czech cbank one-wk rev repo sells out at max 39pct.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1997-06-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Average yield in a Czech National Bank's (CNB) one-week reverse repo tender to drain market liquidity on Monday reached the limit rate of 39 percent, the CNB said.</p>
<p>On Friday, a similar CNB operation sold out at the same 39 percent maximum rate.</p>
